\title{Bitcoin}
\taxon{Protocol}
\author{dhsorens}
\date{2026-08-19}

[https://bitcoin.org](https://bitcoin.org)

\p{
    Its hash functions — double SHA-256 and RIPEMD-160 — are the subject of [SHA-2 and the Bitcoin
    design](dhsorens-004E). Since Taproot its signatures are [Schnorr](dhsorens-004V), specified as
    BIP-340.
}
